{"variant": "iterative", "n": 3, "source": "def hanoi(n, pegs):\n    total_moves = (1 << n) - 1\n    # For odd n, the smallest disk cycles A -> C -> B; for even n, A -> B -> C.\n    step = 2 if n % 2 == 1 else 1\n    smallest_peg = 0\n    for i in range(1, total_moves + 1):\n        if i % 2 == 1:\n            next_peg = (smallest_peg + step) % 3\n            disk = pegs[smallest_peg].pop()\n            pegs[next_peg].append(disk)\n            smallest_peg = next_peg\n        else:\n            a, b = [p for p in (0, 1, 2) if p != smallest_peg]\n            if not pegs[a]:\n                src, dst = b, a\n            elif not pegs[b]:\n                src, dst = a, b\n            elif pegs[a][-1] < pegs[b][-1]:\n                src, dst = a, b\n            else:\n                src, dst = b, a\n            disk = pegs[src].pop()\n            pegs[dst].append(disk)\n", "peg_labels": ["A", "B", "C"], "initial_pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "trace": [{"line": 2, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3}, "move": null, "note": "n=3"}, {"line": 4, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7}, "move": null, "note": "n=3, total_moves=7"}, {"line": 5, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7, "step": 2}, "move": null, "note": "n=3, total_moves=7, step=2"}, {"line": 6, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7, "step": 2, "smallest_peg": 0}, "move": null, "note": "n=3, total_moves=7, step=2, smallest_peg=A"}, {"line": 7, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7, "step": 2, "smallest_peg": 0, "i": 1}, "move": null, "note": "iteration i=1 (smallest disk on peg A; of 7)"}, {"line": 8, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7, "step": 2, "smallest_peg": 0, "i": 1}, "move": null, "note": "iteration i=1 (smallest disk on peg A; of 7)"}, {"line": 9, "pegs": [[3, 2, 1], [], []], "locals": {"n": 3, "total_moves": 7, "step": 2, "smallest_peg": 0, "i": 1, "next_peg":